@startuml
title One integration, four questions, four test oracles

top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontColor #111827
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam ArrowFontColor #374151
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4B5563
  FontColor #111827
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "What claim should\nthe test support?" as claim #DBEAFE

rectangle "1. Did the committed\nartifact change?" as q1 #EDE9FE
rectangle "2. Does the no-op wrapper\npreserve the underlying math?" as q2 #EDE9FE
rectangle "3. Is a changed execution\npath numerically equivalent?" as q3 #EDE9FE
rectangle "4. Is the intentionally\napproximate output acceptable?" as q4 #EDE9FE

rectangle "Artifact-drift oracle\nExact SHA-256 + pinned upstream revision\nFailure means: something moved" as o1 #F8FAFC
rectangle "Paired same-process oracle\nvanilla -> wrapper at threshold 0 -> restore -> vanilla\nExact only where measurement supports it; assert 0 skips" as o2 #DCFCE7
rectangle "Per-variant numerical oracle\nUse byte equality where stable; otherwise use a documented gate\nMark it provisional when the full distribution is missing" as o3 #FEF3C7
rectangle "Quality + engagement oracle\nSSIM against same-process vanilla\nplus a calibrated skip-count band" as o4 #FCE7F3

claim -down-> q1
claim -down-> q2
claim -down-> q3
claim -down-> q4

q1 -right-> o1
q2 -right-> o2
q3 -right-> o3
q4 -right-> o4

q1 -[hidden]down-> q2
q2 -[hidden]down-> q3
q3 -[hidden]down-> q4
o1 -[hidden]down-> o2
o2 -[hidden]down-> o3
o3 -[hidden]down-> o4

caption Conceptual test-selection map. It summarizes the shipped oracle split; it does not identify the unisolated cause of the cross-process byte difference.
@enduml
